<title>FRANCE: French steel output rises in Jan to 1.5 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>French steel output rises in Jan to 1.5 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French steel production rose in January to 1,498,000 million tonnes, up 10.4 percent from year-earlier levels when output was slowed to absorb excess stocks, the French steel association FFA said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
